{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1495516-arcana-combinations","id":1495516,"title":"Arcana combinations.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-24T01:45:15-07:00","id":1495516,"title":"Arcana combinations.","content":"Something I didn't get while reading the chroniclers guide was that if the distinction b/w gross and subtle is removed while allowing any of the remaining 8 arcana as an inferior one gives you 360 combinations in the end.<br /> Shouldn't it be 720 combinations instead? Since 10x9x8=720 and all that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-24T02:15:38-07:00","id":1495517,"title":"","content":"There's one detail you're missing. [10x9x8=720] counts every pair of Ruling Arcana twice. Both Forces-Spirit and Spirit-Forces are part of the total. To get rid of that redundancy, you do have to cut [720] in half.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"